schemaVersion: 1
id: whatsapp-playbook-root
name: WhatsApp Playbook
kind: root
version: 0.1.0
description: Your own WhatsApp, calm. Who is waiting for you, plans made in chats, what the busy groups said, and what you promised.
entry: index.md
domain: Lifestyle
app: my-chats

# No connectors on purpose. Cabinet saves WhatsApp chats into one cabinet (WhatsApp
# Catch-Up), and a cabinet that declares WhatsApp is offered to become that place. This
# one only reads the chats from there and writes its own pages here.

prompts:
  - text: "Who should I answer?"
  - text: "What plans did I make this week?"
  - text: "Catch me up on the family group"
  - text: "What did I promise people?"
  - text: "Who owes me money, and who do I owe?"
  - text: "Find the address someone sent me"
  - text: "Any birthdays coming up in my chats?"
  - text: "Which groups can I mute?"
  - text: "Draft a reply to everyone waiting more than a day"
  - text: "Anything from school this week?"
